# Incident Response Decision Table

| Observation                    | Assessment           | Immediate Action         | Next Step              |
| ------------------------------ | -------------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------- |
| Normal user activity           | Benign               | No containment           | Document               |
| Isolated suspicious event      | Low confidence       | Monitor                  | Investigate            |
| Repeated suspicious events     | Elevated risk        | Increase monitoring      | Investigate            |
| Suspicious authentication      | Potential compromise | Protect account/endpoint | Correlate events       |
| Suspicious privileged activity | High concern         | Escalate                 | Investigate scope      |
| Suspicious PowerShell          | High concern         | Consider containment     | Investigate script     |
| Unauthorized account           | High concern         | Protect account          | Investigate usage      |
| Confirmed compromise           | Incident             | Contain                  | Eradicate              |
| Major compromise               | Critical incident    | Immediate containment    | Full incident response |

